<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-MAJOLI WINS HANOVER GRAND PRIX TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MAJOLI WINS HANOVER GRAND PRIX TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Hanover Grand Prix women's tennis final on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) 4-6 7-6 (7-2) 6-4.</p>
</text>
